# ChangeLog

## 0.1.2

### Fixed

- Dockerfile now builds from local source instead of pulling `aktools` from PyPI
- Docs site (`site/`) served at port 8081 alongside API on 8080
- Added `.dockerignore` to exclude build artifacts from image
- Fixed `COPY site/` / `docker-entrypoint.sh` exclusion by `.dockerignore`

## 0.1.1

### Fixed

- `NameError: logger not defined` during cache restore at startup
- A-share cache key migration on load (`stock_list` → `stock_cn_list`, `stock_spot_*` → `stock_cn_spot_*`)
- Better startup logging for cache.db status (missing / empty / error)

## 0.1.0

First stable release of the AKTools v1 universal API layer. 30+ endpoints across 10 financial categories with smart caching, multi-source switching, API token auth, and Docker support.

### Core

- Smart caching engine: market-hours aware refresh, per-key pause/resume, on-demand response cache, response stale headers
- SQLite cache persistence with crash-safe WAL mode, instant recovery on restart
- API token auth with auto-bootstrapped root token, pre-configured token file, and token CRUD
- Docker: build script, compose file with named volume, deployment guide
- Configurable data directory (`AKTOOLS_DATA_DIR`), log level (`AKTOOLS_LOG_LEVEL`), proxy (`AKSHARE_PROXY`)

### V1 APIs — 10 categories

| Category | List | Spot | History | Search |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| A-shares | stock_cn_list | stock_cn_spot | stock_cn_hist | stock_cn_search |
| US stocks | stock_us_list | stock_us_spot | stock_us_hist | stock_us_search |
| HK stocks | stock_hk_list | stock_hk_spot | stock_hk_hist | stock_hk_search |
| ETF | fund_list | fund_etf_spot | fund_etf_hist | fund_search |
| LOF | — | fund_lof_spot | fund_lof_hist | — |
| Open-end funds | fund_open_list | — | fund_open_hist | fund_open_search |
| Convertible bonds | bond_cov_list | bond_cov_spot | bond_cov_hist | bond_cov_search |
| Futures | — | futures_spot | futures_hist | — |
| Indices | index_list | index_spot | index_hist | index_search |
| Board / Sector | board_industry_list, board_concept_list | board_industry_spot, board_concept_spot | board_industry_hist, board_concept_hist | — |
| Stock profile | stock_profile | — | — | — |

### Management APIs

- `GET /api/public/v1/cache_status` — cache metadata with refresh intervals and paused keys
- `GET /api/public/v1/default_source` — current default data source
- `POST /api/private/v1/default_source` — switch source (auth)
- `POST /api/private/v1/cache/pause?keys=a,b` — per-key or global pause (auth)
- `POST /api/private/v1/cache/resume?keys=a,b` — per-key or global resume (auth)
- `GET/POST/DELETE /api/private/v1/tokens` — token CRUD (auth)

## 0.0.97

### Added

- HK stock universal APIs — `stock_hk_list`, `stock_hk_spot`, `stock_hk_hist`, `stock_hk_search`
- LOF universal APIs — `fund_lof_spot`, `fund_lof_hist`
- Open-end fund universal APIs — `fund_open_list`, `fund_open_hist`, `fund_open_search`
- Futures universal APIs — `futures_spot`, `futures_hist`
- Index universal APIs — `index_list`, `index_spot`, `index_hist`, `index_search`
- Convertible bond universal APIs — `bond_cov_list`, `bond_cov_spot`, `bond_cov_hist`, `bond_cov_search`
- Search endpoints for index, bond_cov, fund_open categories
- Per-key cache pause/resume via `?keys=` parameter (e.g., `?keys=stock_us_spot,stock_us_list`)

### Changed

- Cache pause/resume now supports fine-grained per-key control; backward compatible
- `cache_status` response includes `paused_keys` array

## 0.0.96

### Added

- SQLite-backed API token auth — replaces hardcoded `akshare`/`akfamily` credentials
- Auto-bootstrapped root token on first startup (printed to log)
- Pre-configured token file via `AKTOOLS_TOKENS_FILE` env var (JSON, filesystem-permission protected)
- US stock universal APIs — `stock_us_list` (daily cache), `stock_us_spot` (60s cache), `stock_us_hist` (multi-source)
- `GET /api/public/v1/stock_us_search` — fuzzy search on US stock cache
- Mutating endpoints moved to `/api/private/v1/` requiring auth: cache pause/resume, default_source set, token CRUD

### Changed

- `POST /auth/token` now returns 410 — old credentials deprecated
- Cache management and default_source POST now require Bearer token

## 0.0.95

### Added

- Fund/ETF universal APIs — `fund_list`, `fund_etf_spot`, `fund_etf_hist`
- `GET /api/public/v1/stock_search` & `fund_search` — fuzzy search on cached lists, <10ms
- `GET /api/public/v1/cache_status` — per-cache metadata with refresh intervals
- `POST /api/public/v1/cache/pause` & `resume` — runtime cache control
- Smart caching: market-hours aware (60s trading / 300s off-hours), weekend detection
- Stale-data headers (`X-Cache-Stale`, `X-Cache-Age`) on spot endpoints during market hours
- List pagination (`page`/`page_size`) with `X-Total-Count` header
- Descriptive cache keys (`stock_spot_sina`, `fund_etf_spot`, etc.)
- `stock_info_a_code_name` → `stock_list`, all v1 paths consolidated under `/api/public/v1/`

### Fixed

- Cached list endpoints fast-fail instead of falling back to slow direct calls
- Duplicate stock spot refresh loop removed from cache thread

## 0.0.94

### Added

- Unified A-share spot API (v1) with source switching — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_zh_a_spot`
- In-memory spot cache with background refresh (60s TTL) — responses <10ms after warmup
- Cache fallback — automatically serves from any available source when the requested one is cold
- Warmup gate — returns 503 + `Retry-After` during initial cache population instead of blocking

- Cached A-stock list API — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_info_a_code_name` (daily refresh, <10ms)
- Static cache data refreshes at independent interval (1 day vs 60s for spot)

### Fixed

- Spot cache fallback now checks all sources before attempting slow direct call
- Fallback snapshot recomputed after retry loop to catch late-arriving cache entries
- Stock name whitespace stripped during cache refresh (e.g. "柳    工" → "柳工")

## 0.0.93

### Added

- Docker build script (`docker-build.sh`) and docker-compose file
- Docker deployment guide (`docs/docker-howto.md`) with overseas user config

## 0.0.92

### Added

- Unified A-share history API (v1) with multi-source switching — `GET /api/public/v1/stock_zh_a_hist`
- Proxy support via `AKSHARE_PROXY` environment variable
- Automatic retry on transient network errors (3 attempts, 5-second delay)
- Runtime default data source toggle — `GET/POST /api/v1/default_source`
- Comprehensive API reference documentation (`docs/api-reference.md`)
- V1 API documentation (`docs/v1-api.md`)
- REASONIX.md project knowledge base for AI assistants

### Fixed

- Unhandled AKShare exceptions now return 502 instead of 500
- V1 routes registered before generic catch-all `/api/public/{item_id}` to avoid route mismatch

